Spec: Live Activity snapshot

Purpose:
  What the iOS Live Activity shows for the active ride and when a new snapshot is worth pushing.

Owns:
  ./live_activity_snapshot.dart
  /test/domain/live_activity_snapshot_test.dart

References:
  /docs/specs/history/06-live-activity.md

Must:
  The content carries title, distance text, paused flag, elapsed seconds and the snapshot epoch.
  The title is the paused or recording title chosen by the paused flag.
  The first snapshot is always pushed.
  A later snapshot is pushed only when the distance text, paused flag or title changes, when the widget's own
    elapsed count drifts from the ride's by more than one second, or after 10 minutes as a keep-alive.

Must not:
  Push for ticking elapsed time alone; the widget counts it natively.
